description	"Zam Wesell

An assassin that can don the appearance of the enemy. Possesses a 2-shot sniper rifle.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- KYD-21 Blaster Pistol (Bryar 3)
-- 10% more damage/FP drain
-- 7% slower RoF
- KiSteer 1284 Projectile Rifle
-- 2 shots per reload
-- 30% faster reload
- Thermal Detonator (1)

^6Inventory:
- Electrobinoculars

^8Attributes:
- Healing (2)

^3Abilities:
- Shapeshift (Disguise 3) ^3[Melee Weap Mode]
- Poison Darts (4) ^3[Melee CS1]
- Gunkick ^3[CS2]
- Tracking Darts (8) ^3[Melee CS2]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS3]"